WEBVTT

00:00.280 --> 00:01.720
Come with me to reinforce the south

00:01.800 --> 00:02.080
The Wuzhao

00:02.160 --> 00:03.200
Entered through tunnels

00:03.280 --> 00:04.680
Won't be too many

00:05.160 --> 00:05.960
The west

00:06.040 --> 00:07.000
Has General Liu

00:07.080 --> 00:08.160
They want to take the gates

00:08.320 --> 00:09.200
Won't be easy

00:09.280 --> 00:10.680
Their target this time

00:11.040 --> 00:12.720
Is likely the south grain depot

00:12.800 --> 00:13.480
Let's go

00:13.560 --> 00:14.240
To the south

00:14.320 --> 00:15.720
I accept the order

00:28.040 --> 00:29.440
Hurry

00:32.520 --> 00:33.920
Just as brother-in-law predicted

00:34.200 --> 00:35.720
Four groups of Wuzhao came

00:35.800 --> 00:36.520
All eliminated

00:36.680 --> 00:37.360
The grain

00:37.440 --> 00:38.200
Has been moved in batches to

00:38.280 --> 00:39.680
More hidden locations

00:40.040 --> 00:41.080
Hurry

00:41.160 --> 00:42.560
Report

00:44.200 --> 00:44.560
Report

00:44.680 --> 00:45.960
Enemy main force has moved

00:46.040 --> 00:47.440
Reinforcing the west gate

